    card. Names match the `SajuKoreanCalculator` domain model
    so copy-pasting a model field name to a stringResource key
    is a 1:1 mapping.

    Conventions:
      - Display name uses Hangul with Hanji in parentheses: 갑(甲)
      - For user-facing labels, use the most common Korean reading
        (e.g. "용신" not "용신(Yongshin)"; Hanji is dropped in body copy).
      - End every sentence with the appropriate Korean sentence-ender
        (습니다 / 요 / 해요 / etc).
-->
